{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no escape, only battle. On a mysterious island, an ancestral refuge withstands an endless attack. Defe must explore, build natural fortifications, and grow stronger to face the danger \u2013 with or without allies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A survival game with just the right mix of strategy and action? Defe\u2019s got it covered.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun sets, enemies grow more dangerous. Face the shadows with courage, defend your base through the darkness, and celebrate the coming of a new day. The cycle of time changes everything\u2014even your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/33b69e622da9939aea6ceb0eadd7ba0d.poster.avif?t=1757460986\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/33b69e622da9939aea6ceb0eadd7ba0d.webm?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/33b69e622da9939aea6ceb0eadd7ba0d.mp4?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Defe The Defender</i>, the path to survival is literally in your hands. Build and rebuild stone mazes as you please, adapt your defences in real time, and create perfect traps. Every layout tells a story\u2014and you\u2019re the author.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/880296d51615b0db7cc749c21b594307.poster.avif?t=1757460986\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/880296d51615b0db7cc749c21b594307.webm?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/880296d51615b0db7cc749c21b594307.mp4?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defending isn\u2019t just about fighting\u2014it\u2019s about managing. Build farms, harvest resources, and keep your base self\u2011sufficient. Your economy matters as much as your defence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/053b135fdb50fb6f80d7bc9dc331ec6b.poster.avif?t=1757460986\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/053b135fdb50fb6f80d7bc9dc331ec6b.webm?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/053b135fdb50fb6f80d7bc9dc331ec6b.mp4?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of enemies will test your reflexes and creativity. And when the bosses arrive\u2026 you\u2019d better be ready. Every battle is unique, and surviving means thinking fast\u2014and hitting harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c804f162e2f61d4abf340eea89729799.poster.avif?t=1757460986\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c804f162e2f61d4abf340eea89729799.webm?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c804f162e2f61d4abf340eea89729799.mp4?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready. The island lives, breathes \u2013 and resists. Build, explore, and fight intense battles, and you might even catch the sunrise (if you survive the night).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defe The Defender</strong> is a top-down strategy and action game where every resource matters and every decision could be your last. Build your shelter during the day, fortify your base, uncover the forest\u2019s secrets, and prepare to defend it all at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you balance defense and exploration? A more complex maze or more allies? Will you face enemies with ranged weapons or stand your ground using nature\u2019s magic? Each night brings a new challenge\u2014but nothing beats watching the sun rise over your ancestral refuge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400890?t=1757460986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400890?t=1757460986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/e96babfc0291fa3cd13fe94a09346156d4de70e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757460986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/e96babfc0291fa3cd13fe94a09346156d4de70e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757460986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"