"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c804f162e2f61d4abf340eea89729799.webm?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/extras/c804f162e2f61d4abf340eea89729799.mp4?t=1757460986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready. The island lives, breathes \u2013 and resists. Build, explore, and fight intense battles, and you might even catch the sunrise (if you survive the night).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defe The Defender</strong> is a top-down strategy and action game where every resource matters and every decision could be your last. Build your shelter during the day, fortify your base, uncover the forest\u2019s secrets, and prepare to defend it all at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you balance defense and exploration? A more complex maze or more allies? Will you face enemies with ranged weapons or stand your ground using nature\u2019s magic? Each night brings a new challenge\u2014but nothing beats watching the sun rise over your ancestral refuge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Curare Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400890/3699ec01852f703ec6e6060e433bc4df418011e0/header.jpg?t=1757460986","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04.5 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"ma